/* 堆叠卡组：卡片不透明（白底 + 角色色渐变），叠放时没有拼接色块，也不露出页面灰底 */
.deck {
  position: relative;
  height: 760rpx;
  margin: 24rpx 0 0;
}

.deck-card {
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 50%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  width: 560rpx;
  height: 700rpx;
  margin-left: -280rpx;
  padding: 36rpx 32rpx 28rpx;
  border-radius: 52rpx;
  border-radius: var(--radius-l1);
  background: #ffffff;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--role-soft) 0%, #ffffff 70%);
  border: 2rpx solid #ffffff;
  box-shadow: 0 20rpx 56rpx rgba(34, 52, 84, 0.14);
  transform-origin: 50% 100%;
  transition: transform 320ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1), opacity 320ms ease;
  overflow: hidden;
}

/* 后面的卡片只露出各自角色色的卡面，内容翻到最前面时再淡入 */
.deck-card-back {
  background: #dde6f5;
  background: var(--role-soft);
}

.deck-body {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
  transition: opacity 240ms ease;
}

.deck-card-back .deck-body {
  opacity: 0;
}

.deck-card-front {
  box-shadow: 0 28rpx 72rpx rgba(34, 52, 84, 0.2);
}

.deck-card-picked {
  border-color: #3d5a80;
  border-color: var(--role-primary);
}

.deck-dragging .deck-card-front {
  transition: none;
}

.deck-current {
  position: absolute;
  top: 24rpx;
  right: 24rpx;
}

.deck-face {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  height: 280rpx;
}

.deck-name {
  margin-top: 12rpx;
  color: #22344d;
  color: var(--role-ink);
  font-size: 44rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.deck-tagline {
  margin-top: 6rpx;
  color: #22344d;
  color: var(--role-ink);
  font-size: 27rpx;
}

.deck-desc {
  margin-top: 14rpx;
  color: #474e54;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  font-size: 25rpx;
  line-height: 1.6;
  text-align: center;
}

.deck-voice {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 16rpx;
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 60rpx;
  margin-top: auto;
  padding-top: 18rpx;
  border-top: 1rpx solid rgba(30, 45, 70, 0.08);
  border-top: 1rpx solid var(--border-default);
}

.deck-voice-name {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  color: #474e54;
  color: var(--text-secondary);
  font-size: 24rpx;
}

.deck-play {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0 28rpx;
  height: 60rpx;
  line-height: 60rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: #3d5a80;
  background: var(--role-primary);
  color: #ffffff;
  font-size: 25rpx;
}

.deck-play-on {
  background: #22344d;
  background: var(--role-ink);
}

.deck-dots {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 12rpx;
  margin: 4rpx 0 28rpx;
}

.deck-dot {
  width: 12rpx;
  height: 12rpx;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background: rgba(30, 45, 70, 0.18);
  transition: width 250ms ease;
}

.deck-dot-on {
  width: 32rpx;
  border-radius: 999rpx;
  background: #172f43;
  background: var(--brand-deep);
}

.deck-hint {
  display: block;
  text-align: center;
}

.companion-voice {
  margin-top: 20rpx;
  padding-top: 8rpx;
  padding-bottom: 8rpx;
}

.companion-voice .setting-row + .setting-row {
  border-top: 1rpx solid rgba(30, 45, 70, 0.08);
}
